Package: sshdeploy
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash-shlib, rsync, openssh-client, apache2
Description: Website deployment and remote execution utilities
 sshdeploy provides utilities for deploying websites to remote servers
 and executing commands remotely.
 .
 This package includes:
  * cdrun: Change directory and run commands, with support for finding
    directories by searching for ancestor or descendant files.
  * deployweb: Website deployment utility that finds the project root,
    builds using pnpm, syncs files via rsync, and configures Apache
    virtual hosts.
  * push-to: File synchronization utility used by deployweb and runon.
  * runon: Push files and run commands on remote servers via SSH.

